    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/0b4743e7ed132dbed1e26f7581b92d1b.avif?t=1723464585\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><i><strong>The Last Child</strong> is an atmospheric side-scrolling game that gives you the opportunity to accept your past and continue living in the present.<br>In it you will go through a number of locations, each of which is imbued with its own history and atmosphere, has its own mechanics and secrets. There are no right or wrong decisions, there is only the fate of the character and your choice.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >START YOUR ADVENTURE HERE</h2><strong>Along the way</strong>, you will experience a sense of danger and good luck, see mysterious creatures, touch magic with your own hands and much more.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel through a fairy-tale world.<br></li><li>Discover new lands. <br></li><li>Get secret achievements. <br></li><li>Solve interesting puzzles.</li></ul><strong>And don't forget, you are the last child.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/0d4ccafcf7a4c035a10e764f2931a7f6.poster.avif?t=1723464585\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/0d4ccafcf7a4c035a10e764f2931a7f6.webm?t=1723464585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/0d4ccafcf7a4c035a10e764f2931a7f6.mp4?t=1723464585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN THE WHOLE HISTORY STEP BY STEP</h2><i><strong>Ancient scriptures say</strong></i>: \u201cIn a universe filled with the forces of light and darkness, there lived a girl named <i>Aliye</i>. She gained both powers, but despite her desire to keep only the light, the darkness will continue to absorb the light, and after that Aliye...\u201d Find a way out of this situation and find out what the reason was. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/91cdb4224b0b5188e8c5f35fb94e8654.poster.avif?t=1723464585\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/91cdb4224b0b5188e8c5f35fb94e8654.webm?t=1723464585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/91cdb4224b0b5188e8c5f35fb94e8654.mp4?t=1723464585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BEGINNING AND THE END IS UNCHANGEABLE, BUT THE PATH IS DIFFERENT OR NOT?</h2>Select the answer options and decide what you need to do to continue on your desired path. Show your fearlessness or prudence in various situations to learn more about this world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/398be950d1c17e73736d987184de9dc9.webp?t=1723464585\" width=600 height=30 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/0b4743e7ed132dbed1e26f7581b92d1b.avif?t=1723464585\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><i><strong>The Last Child</strong> is an atmospheric side-scrolling game that gives you the opportunity to accept your past and continue living in the present.<br>In it you will go through a number of locations, each of which is imbued with its own history and atmosphere, has its own mechanics and secrets. There are no right or wrong decisions, there is only the fate of the character and your choice.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >START YOUR ADVENTURE HERE</h2><strong>Along the way</strong>, you will experience a sense of danger and good luck, see mysterious creatures, touch magic with your own hands and much more.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel through a fairy-tale world.<br></li><li>Discover new lands. <br></li><li>Get secret achievements. <br></li><li>Solve interesting puzzles.</li></ul><strong>And don't forget, you are the last child.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/0d4ccafcf7a4c035a10e764f2931a7f6.poster.avif?t=1723464585\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/0d4ccafcf7a4c035a10e764f2931a7f6.webm?t=1723464585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/0d4ccafcf7a4c035a10e764f2931a7f6.mp4?t=1723464585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN THE WHOLE HISTORY STEP BY STEP</h2><i><strong>Ancient scriptures say</strong></i>: \u201cIn a universe filled with the forces of light and darkness, there lived a girl named <i>Aliye</i>. She gained both powers, but despite her desire to keep only the light, the darkness will continue to absorb the light, and after that Aliye...\u201d Find a way out of this situation and find out what the reason was. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/91cdb4224b0b5188e8c5f35fb94e8654.poster.avif?t=1723464585\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/91cdb4224b0b5188e8c5f35fb94e8654.webm?t=1723464585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/91cdb4224b0b5188e8c5f35fb94e8654.mp4?t=1723464585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BEGINNING AND THE END IS UNCHANGEABLE, BUT THE PATH IS DIFFERENT OR NOT?</h2>Select the answer options and decide what you need to do to continue on your desired path. Show your fearlessness or prudence in various situations to learn more about this world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575510/extras/398be950d1c17e73736d987184de9dc9.webp?t=1723464585\" width=600 height=30 /></span>",
